@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Create a category → 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Books"}

> {% client.global.set("categoryId", response.body.id); %}

### Same name, different case → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "books"}

### Blank name → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "  "}

### List categories → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

### Get the created category → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}

### Unknown category → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/999999

### Rename the category → 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Novels"}

### Delete the category → 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
